  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for a richer society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Church Aid Burkina Faso will implement a multi-sectoral response focusing on climate-resilient WASH, anticipatory and climate action, as well as emergency and food response, aiming to improve hygiene, sanitation, water access, and food security in vulnerable IDP and host communities across Boucle de Mouhoun and Est. The response will deliver lifesaving support to vulnerable individuals in the targeted areas, including women, girls, and people living with disabilities, and will be implemented together with two local partners, Sos Jeunesse and the Buaminyaba association.</narrative>
  </description>
